  <body>
    <h1>YOUR NAME</h1>
    <p><strong>Title:</strong> Professional Title</p>
    <p><strong>Contact:</strong> City, Country • you@example.com • +123 456 7890 • https://your.site</p>

    <h2>Summary</h2>
    <p>A concise professional summary (2–3 sentences) highlighting core skills and career goals.</p>

    <h2>Experience</h2>
    <h3>Job Title — Company Name</h3>
    <p>City, Country | Month Year – Present</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Brief description of responsibilities and achievements.</li>
      <li>Use 1–2 bullet points for measurable outcomes (metrics, improvements).</li>
    </ul>

    <h3>Job Title — Company Name</h3>
    <p>City, Country | Month Year – Month Year</p>
    <ul>
      <li>Description of role and key accomplishments.</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Education</h2>
    <p><strong>Degree</strong>, Major — University Name (Year)</p>

    <h2>Skills</h2>
    <ul>
      <li>Skill A — Proficiency</li>
      <li>Skill B — Proficiency</li>
      <li>Tools: Tool1, Tool2, Tool3</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Projects</h2>
    <p>Project Name — short one-line description and technologies used. Link: https://example.com</p>

    <h2>Languages</h2>
    <p>Language — Level</p>

    <hr />
    <p style="font-size:12px;color:#666">This is a generated sample DOCX file saved as HTML for compatibility; open in Microsoft Word and save as a proper .docx if desired.</p>
